WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.800
Hi, I'm Sukhraj Singh, and welcome to my little corner of the internet. I'm a Computer Science professional interested in understanding the systems that make technology work behind the scenes.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:21.600
My journey has taken me through networking, Linux, cloud infrastructure, and practical experience with Toys“R”Us, Nokia, and Algoma University.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:29.100
What interests me most is learning how software applications get deployed,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:37.000
how networks communicate, and how infrastructure can be automated and made more reliable.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:50.500
Along the way, I've worked with technologies like AWS, Terraform, Docker, Linux, GitHub Actions, Python, and more.
